========================================================================
Sherpa-ONNX (Speech Recognition)
========================================================================
License: Apache License 2.0
Source: https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx

The Sherpa-ONNX recognizer library (libsherpa-onnx-jni.so) is packaged
in the app. The speech model (zh_en_small_int8, Apache 2.0) is not
packaged; the app downloads it on first use and checks its SHA-256
before unpacking it. Its files:
- encoder-epoch-99-avg-1.int8.onnx
- joiner-epoch-99-avg-1.int8.onnx
- decoder-epoch-99-avg-1.onnx
- bpe.model
- tokens.txt

